WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.091
Place a handspan carefully along the same length without gaps. This door is eight

00:00:05.091 --> 00:00:05.789
handspans wide.

00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:10.777
Use the same small cup each time. Bucket A holds five cupfuls.

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:14.411
Bucket B holds seven cupfuls with the same cup.

00:00:15.617 --> 00:00:20.097
Seven cups is more than five cups. Bucket B has greater capacity.
